  "note": "B1 liść · first vocab pack of B1 — a new REGISTER (plans & arrangements), not a topic revisit. Rides b1_perf_future: the payoff is future plans said with the perfective forms he now owns (kupię, zrobię) plus będę + imperfective. ANCHORS, never re-taught: plan, spotkanie, bilet, podróż, wakacje, zakupy, koncert, telefon, jutro, w weekend, z bratem, na biurku. PERFECTIVE TRIO — obiecać, załatwić, umówić się are perfective infinitives; exact a2_school2 zdać/oblać treatment: they appear ONLY as bare infinitives after mogę / muszę / chcę (can_inf), never conjugated, never in the past, never after będę (ungrammatical with a perfective). planować (-uję like pracuję) and zamierzać (-am like czytam) are imperfective: conjugated 1/2/3sg only, and planować may follow będę. rezerwację is taught explicitly because Zrobię rezerwację demands it (every-form-taught); same kawa→kawę move. Time chunks taught WHOLE: w przyszłym tygodniu mirrors the taught chunk w zeszłym tygodniu, pojutrze mirrors przedwczoraj, za tydzień = za + known tydzień. HOMOGRAPH NOTES: podróż and wakacje were taught as nominatives and are reused here as accusatives — soft-feminine and non-virile-plural accusatives are string-identical to the nominative, same legitimate overlap as brata acc/gen; 'to' in Muszę to załatwić is the taught demonstrative doing object-pronoun duty ('it'), carried by an explain. Nouns badged m/f; verbs and chunks take no badge.",
